{
  "description": "Gradebook T4 observatory: the headline cost-per-correct-decision metric (ADR 0001, math+reality grade sources only), per-model right-sizing evidence, correct-rate for the grade-quality-drop alert, cost-over-time for the spend-spike alert, and a clearly-labeled AI-judge secondary view that never counts toward the headline. Built for issue #7 (T4).",
